<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, padding: '60px', background: '#FFFFFF', fontFamily: '"Microsoft YaHei", Arial, sans-serif' }}>
  <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', width: '100%', height: '100%', gap: 22 }}>

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 12 }}>
      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'flex-end', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E293B', lineHeight: 1.2 }}>
          创新服务池与 AIDC 数学同构，差 8 倍全是口径
        </Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#64748B' }}>300 人，每人每月 100 万 Token，Qwen3.6-35B-A3B</Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ width: '100%', height: 2, background: '#2563EB' }} />
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', width: '100%', gap: 40, flex: 1 }}>

      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', width: 300, gap: 2, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 96, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#B45309', lineHeight: 1.05 }}>7.99</Text>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'flex-end', gap: 8, marginTop: -4 }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 30, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#B45309' }}>倍</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#64748B', paddingBottom: 6 }}>MoE 模型，Dense 为 7.33 倍</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ width: 100, height: 2, background: '#E2E8F0', marginTop: 14, marginBottom: 14 }} />
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#1E293B', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>
          创新池的全部差异都可精确分解为三个系数的乘积，且与规模、模型、请求长度、峰值倍数全部无关。
        </Text>
      </Box>

      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', flex: 1, gap: 14 }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', width: '100%', gap: 12 }}>
          <Box style={{ width: 130 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#64748B' }}>口径环节</Text>
          </Box>
          <Box style={{ width: 130 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#64748B' }}>倍数</Text>
          </Box>
          <Box style={{ flex: 1 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#64748B' }}>实质</Text>
          </Box>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ width: '100%', height: 1, background: '#E2E8F0' }} />

        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', width: '100%', gap: 12, paddingTop: 6, paddingBottom: 6 }}>
          <Box style={{ width: 130 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E293B' }}>时间基准</Text>
          </Box>
          <Box style={{ width: 130 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 26, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#B45309' }}>4.0909</Text>
          </Box>
          <Box style={{ flex: 1 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#334155', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
              整月额度压进 22 日 × 8 小时工作窗口，AIDC 按自然月均摊
            </Text>
          </Box>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ width: '100%', height: 1, background: '#E2E8F0' }} />

        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', width: '100%', gap: 12, paddingTop: 6, paddingBottom: 6 }}>
          <Box style={{ width: 130 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E293B' }}>结构修正</Text>
          </Box>
          <Box style={{ width: 130 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 26, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#B45309' }}>1.20</Text>
          </Box>
          <Box style={{ flex: 1 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#334155', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
              用 1.2 补 MoE 路由与门控开销，AIDC 只用单一 F 值，无此项
            </Text>
          </Box>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ width: '100%', height: 1, background: '#E2E8F0' }} />

        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', width: '100%', gap: 12, paddingTop: 6, paddingBottom: 6 }}>
          <Box style={{ width: 130 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E293B' }}>效率口径</Text>
          </Box>
          <Box style={{ width: 130 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 26, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#B45309' }}>1.6286</Text>
          </Box>
          <Box style={{ flex: 1 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#334155', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
              分阶段效率谐波等效 0.276，AIDC 用单一 N 值 45%，换成 40% 则降为 7.11 倍
            </Text>
          </Box>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ width: '100%', height: 1, background: '#E2E8F0' }} />

        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', width: '100%', gap: 12, paddingTop: 6 }}>
          <Box style={{ width: 130 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#64748B' }}>验算</Text>
          </Box>
          <Box style={{ width: 130 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#64748B' }}>4.09 × 1.20 × 1.63</Text>
          </Box>
          <Box style={{ flex: 1 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#334155', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
              把三项逐一拉回 AIDC 口径，残差精确收敛到 1.0000
            </Text>
          </Box>
        </Box>

      </Box>

    </Box>

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', width: '100%', gap: 14 }}>
      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', flex: 1, background: '#F1F5F9', borderRadius: 8, padding: '12px 18px', gap: 2 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#64748B' }}>能改变这个倍数的，只有输入占比</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#1E293B', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
          <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#B45309' }}>50% 达 10.5 倍</span>　　<span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold' }}>100% 降至 6.3 倍</span>
        </Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', flex: 1, background: '#F1F5F9', borderRadius: 8, padding: '12px 18px', gap: 2 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#64748B' }}>以及服务窗口口径</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#1E293B', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
          <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold' }}>22 日 × 24 小时</span> 降至 2.67 倍，<span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold' }}>30 日 × 24 小时</span> 降至 1.95 倍
        </Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', flex: 1, background: '#FEF3C7', borderRadius: 8, padding: '12px 18px', gap: 2 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#92400E' }}>比系数更关键的缺口</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#92400E', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
          <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold' }}>创新池主链路不出卡数</span>，只在费用附录出现
        </Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>

    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#94A3B8' }}>AIDC2026 vs ComputePlanner　口径对比</Text>

  </Box>
</Slide>
